cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DRE Search: Typesense-backed faceted search for Omeka S"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Frédérick
    family-names: Madore
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0959-2092"
    affiliation: "University of Bayreuth"
abstract: >-
  DRE Search is an Omeka S module that adds Typesense-backed faceted search to
  the Africa Multiple Cluster of Excellence's Digital Research Environment.
  Twelve search corpora — research items, research projects, publications,
  podcasts, YouTube videos, people, research sections, organisations, and the
  genre, language, location and subject authority terms — ship as configurable
  search profiles, each an independent Typesense collection with its own
  facets, sorts and result card. The index is built directly from the Omeka
  dashboard over MySQL, with no external ingestion pipeline, and Typesense is
  optional: with no backend configured the module installs cleanly and the site
  runs normally.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AM-Digital-Research-Environment/DRESearch"
url: "https://data.africamultiple.uni-bayreuth.de/s/amira"
